<title>USA: Irish prime minister arrives in United States.</title>
<headline>Irish prime minister arrives in United States.</headline>
<dateline>ANDREWS AIR FORCE BASE, Md. 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish Prime Minister John Bruton arrived late Sunday in the United States ahead of a meeting with President Bill Clinton on Monday.</p>
<p>Bruton's plane landed at Andrews Air Force Base in Maryland, according to base officials.</p>
<p>Bruton is due to meet Clinton at the White House at 6 P.M. EDT (2200 GMT).</p>
</text>
